flowchart LR
    %% 上半区：中文全PG链路
    subgraph 中文_全PG数据写入链路_离线异步
        W1[原始数据入库<br>文档/日志/知识库<br>PG原生支持] --> W2[数据清洗预处理<br>去重/格式标准化<br>PG内置PL/pgSQL脚本]
        W2 --> W3[数据切片<br>长文本语义切分<br>继承元数据生成唯一ID<br>PG + pgvector 辅助存储<br>模型：Llama 3/Qwen2 语义切分模型]
        W3 --> W4[三路并行处理]
        W4 --> W5[向量分支<br>生成文本Embedding<br>写入向量库<br>构建HNSW ANN索引<br>PG + pgvector 扩展<br>模型：nomic-embed-text/BGE-M3]
        W4 --> W6[关键词分支<br>生成BM25倒排索引<br>存入全文检索引擎<br>PG + pg_trgm + GIN 索引扩展]
        W4 --> W7[知识图谱分支<br>实体抽取/关系链接<br>写入图数据库<br>PG + Apache AGE 图扩展]
        W5 & W6 & W7 --> W8[全量索引校验<br>一致性校验完成<br>PG原生事务校验]
        W8 --> W9[索引对外可服务<br>PG + PostgREST 自动生成API]
    end

    subgraph 中文_全PG数据读取链路_在线实时
        R1[用户输入Query] --> R2[意图识别<br>分类用户真实诉求<br>PG + pgml 机器学习扩展<br>模型：BERT-base/IntentBERT]
        R2 --> R3[查询重写<br>消歧/补全/生成优化检索式<br>PG + plpython3u 调用大模型<br>模型：GPT-4o-mini/Qwen3-7B]
        R3 --> R4[多路召回触发]
        R4 --> R5[语义向量召回<br>Query生成Embedding<br>向量库ANN检索<br>PG + pgvector 向量检索<br>模型：nomic-embed-text/SimCSE]
        R4 --> R6[关键词召回<br>倒排索引BM25匹配<br>PG + tsvector + GIN 索引查询]
        R4 --> R7[知识图谱关联召回<br>实体关联扩展检索<br>PG + Apache AGE Cypher查询]
        R5 & R6 & R7 --> R8[候选集融合去重<br>得到Top-K粗筛结果<br>PG原生SQL集合运算]
        R8 --> R9[重排序<br>深度语义模型精细打分<br>PG + pgml 模型推理<br>模型：CrossEncoder/BERT-reranker]
        R9 --> R10[结果过滤<br>权限/时效性校验<br>PG原生行级安全RLS]
        R10 --> R11[从原始文档库取对应片段<br>PG原生JSONB字段查询]
        R11 --> R12[整理格式化返回给用户<br>PG + plpgsql 结果格式化]
    end

    %% 下半区：英文全PG链路
    subgraph English_All_PG_Data_Write_Pipeline_Offline
        EW1[Raw Data Ingestion<br>Doc/Log/Knowledge Base<br>PG Native Support] --> EW2[Data Cleaning<br>Dedupe/Format Standardization<br>PG Built-in PL/pgSQL Script]
        EW2 --> EW3[Data Chunking<br>Semantic Split Long Text<br>Assign Unique ID with Metadata<br>PG + pgvector Aux Storage<br>Model: Llama 3/GPT-4o-mini Semantic Splitter]
        EW3 --> EW4[3-Way Parallel Processing]
        EW4 --> EW5[Vector Branch<br>Generate Text Embedding<br>Write to Vector DB<br>Build HNSW ANN Index<br>PG + pgvector Extension<br>Model: nomic-embed-text/bge-m3]
        EW4 --> EW6[Keyword Branch<br>Build BM25 Inverted Index<br>Store in Full-Text Engine<br>PG + pg_trgm + GIN Index Extension]
        EW4 --> EW7[Knowledge Graph Branch<br>Entity Extraction/Relation Linking<br>Write to Graph DB<br>PG + Apache AGE Graph Extension]
        EW5 & EW6 & EW7 --> EW8[Full Index Validation<br>Consistency Check<br>PG Native Transaction Validation]
        EW8 --> EW9[Index Ready for Service<br>PG + PostgREST Auto API Generation]
    end

    subgraph English_All_PG_Data_Read_Pipeline_Online
        ER1[User Input Query] --> ER2[Intent Recognition<br>Classify User Real Demand<br>PG + pgml ML Extension<br>Model: BERT-base/IntentBERT]
        ER2 --> ER3[Query Rewriting<br>Disambiguate/Complete/Generate Optimized Query<br>PG + plpython3u LLM Call<br>Model: GPT-4o-mini/Llama 3-7B]
        ER3 --> ER4[Multi-Channel Retrieval Trigger]
        ER4 --> ER5[Semantic Vector Retrieval<br>Generate Query Embedding<br>Vector DB ANN Search<br>PG + pgvector Vector Search<br>Model: nomic-embed-text/all-MiniLM-L6-v2]
        ER4 --> ER6[Keyword Retrieval<br>Inverted Index BM25 Match<br>PG + tsvector + GIN Index Query]
        ER4 --> ER7[Knowledge Graph Retrieval<br>Entity Linking Extended Search<br>PG + Apache AGE Cypher Query]
        ER5 & ER6 & ER7 --> ER8[Candidate Set Fusion & Dedupe<br>Get Top-K Coarse Results<br>PG Native SQL Set Operation]
        ER8 --> ER9[Reranking<br>Deep Semantic Model Fine Scoring<br>PG + pgml Model Inference<br>Model: CrossEncoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2]
        ER9 --> ER10[Result Filtering<br>Permission/Timeliness Check<br>PG Native Row Level Security RLS]
        ER10 --> ER11[Fetch Original Doc Snippets<br>PG Native JSONB Field Query]
        ER11 --> ER12[Format & Return to User<br>PG + plpgsql Result Formatting]
    end
